{25}{Me boat!  I cared for me wife less than this boat!  Why in the name a' all that's unholy would I give ye me boat?  Yer speakin' gibberish, and I had more'n an earful of it...a soul as tormented as me own has got little patience for the blubberings of the living...}{Me boat!  I cared for me wife less than this boat!  Why in the name a' all that's unholy would I give ye me boat?  Yer speakin' gibberish, and I had more'n an earful of it...a soul as tormented as me own has got little patience for the blubberings of the living...}{}{}{}{}
