{54}{I cursed meself!  I spilled the blood of innocents, desecrated holy places, and...the worst thing I ever did...I broke a pirates' blood oath.  Even without the first two, I deserved what I got because a' the last.  I shouldn't even call meself a pirate, after what I did...}{I cursed meself!  I spilled the blood of innocents, desecrated holy places, and...the worst thing I ever did...I broke a pirates' blood oath.  Even without the first two, I deserved what I got because a' the last.  I shouldn't even call meself a pirate, after the things I did...}{}{}{}{}
