{62}{Break the curse?  [The ghost is silent for a moment, contemplating.]  And why would ye want to do that, matey?  Why would one such as ye want to be helpin' the evil ghost a' old Stringy Pete?}{Break the curse?  [The ghost is silent for a moment, contemplating.]  And why would ye want to do that, lassie?  Why would one such as ye want to be helpin' the evil ghost a' old Stringy Pete?}{}{}{}{}
