{94}{The first be an easy task.  I told ye, I killed many an innocent in me time, a good 'n pure man by the name a' Jonas Williamson.  Killed him for the silver buckles on his boots, but mostly for the sport a' it.  I laughed while he bled into the gutter, a' cryin' out to me that I spare his family...}{The first be an easy task.  I told ye, I killed many an innocent in me time, a good 'n pure man by the name a' Jonas Williamson.  Killed him for the silver buckles on his boots, but mostly for the sport a' it.  I laughed while he bled into the gutter, a' cryin' out to me that I spare his family...}{}{}{}{}
