{117}{The second task...that might be a little more complicated.  There be a temple in the hills just off the Gulf a' Morbihan, in a little town called Vooriden, and many years ago I was a'pillagin' the surrounding countryside, and I broke into the place, and stole some holy relics, and desecrated their sacred altar.  And sure enough, those old monks threw a curse on me...}{The second task...that might be a little more complicated.  There be a temple in the hills just off the Gulf a' Morbihan, in a little town called Vooriden, and many years ago I was a'pillagin' the surrounding countryside, and I broke into the place, and stole some holy relics, and desecrated their sacred altar.  And sure enough, those old monks threw a curse on me...}{}{}{}{}
