{135}{The last task will be the most difficult.  Ye see, as I was getting' on in years, there was nothin' I hadn't done, and nowhere I hadn't sailed, and no treasure I hadn't laid me hands on.  There was only one thing I wanted, and I wasn't even sure if'n it existed, and I made it me business to find out...}{The last task will be the most difficult.  Ye see, as I was getting' on in years, there was nothin' I hadn't done, and nowhere I hadn't sailed, and no treasure I hadn't laid me hands on.  There was only one thing I wanted, and I wasn't even sure if'n it existed, and I made it me business to find out...}{}{}{}{}
