{144}{The Bangellian Scourge is the most evil piece a' weaponry ever wielded by any soul in the land a' Arcanum.  Legend says it was forged in the blood fires a' the Bangellian Deeps, and that virgins and children were thrown into the fire to keep it stoked...}{The Bangellian Scourge is the most evil piece a' weaponry ever wielded by any soul in the land a' Arcanum.  Legend says it was forged in the blood fires a' the Bangellian Deeps, and that virgins and children were thrown into the fire to keep it stoked...}{}{}{}{}
