{150}{Horrible don't even come close.  It also be said that the Bane 'a Kree cut down a whole battalion a' Elven warriors with it before he was banished, and that Lorek wielded it during the dwarven Clan Wars, and that any but the most evil of a' people die at the mere sight of it...}{Horrible don't even come close.  It also be said that the Bane 'a Kree cut down a whole battalion a' Elven warriors with it before he was banished, and that Lorek wielded it during the dwarven Clan Wars, and that any but the most evil of a' people die at the mere sight of it...}{}{}{}{}
