{160}{Yes, matey...and an evil blade it be.  I wanted it more than anything in the all of Arcanum.  And I planned on getting' me hands on it...}{Yes, missy...and an evil blade it be.  I wanted it more than anything in the all of Arcanum.  And I planned on getting' me hands on it...}{}{}{}{}
