{170}{At the time I had me a crew of seven a' the most black-hearted and soulless pirates, and they all agreed it was a fine piece a treasure to go after, and we took a pirates blood-oath to stand by one another share in the treasure.  And so we searched Arcanum for it, and found it one day we did...in the swamps of the Dark Fens, down in the Bangellian Deeps...}{At the time I had me a crew of seven a' the most black-hearted and soulless pirates, and they all agreed it was a fine piece a treasure to go after, and we took a pirates blood-oath to stand by one another share in the treasure.  And so we searched Arcanum for it, and found it one day we did...in the swamps of the Dark Fens, down in the Bangellian Deeps...}{}{}{}{}
