{175}{It'd been buried there for centuries...a beautiful sight...its blade as black as onyx, and carved in ancient runework, and I held it in me hands, and it CALLED to me...}{It'd been buried there for centuries...a beautiful sight...its blade as black as onyx, and carved in ancient runework, and I held it in me hands, and it CALLED to me...}{}{}{}{}
