{180}{We ALL did nothin' matey.  That night, when everyone was asleep, that cursed blade twisted my mind, and it told me that my crew was mutinous, and looking to get rid of me.  And so I killed them all in their sleep, matey...cut all their throats from ear to ear.  When I woke in the mornin', and seen what I done, I threw the blade down and ran right out of there...}{We ALL did nothin' lassie.  That night, when everyone was asleep, that cursed blade twisted my mind, and it told me that my crew was mutinous, and looking to get rid of me.  And so I killed them all in their sleep, missy...cut all their throats from ear to ear.  When I woke in the mornin', and seen what I done, I threw the blade down and ran right out of there...}{}{}{}{}
